{"posts":[{"id":"3drive_p2_26","t":"","a":"okami","d":"","n":"#26","p":2,"im":["79a41afb65d299d95edf842793287990fa5f3d1c"],"m":26},{"id":"3drive_p2_27","t":"good game","a":"FX.Sniffer","d":"","n":"#27","p":2,"im":["c800cfa8a3ff233e98399a562c4642e0355f29f5"],"m":27},{"id":"3drive_p2_28","t":"Josh wrote:\n\nYup. That's a 3drive. I really don't know where the term comes from, but the CP in it and the psychology behind it make alot of sense. It's quite a common pattern, and provides very low risk setups.\n\nI know I ask people to look for patterns - this is to get a concrete starting point in learning to read price. <strong>Once folk start to seek out these patterns, they'll begin to notice a myriad other phenomena, which will\n\nbecome very important EUREKA moments for them</strong> - I just love those EUREKA moments:cheer:\n\nWhen you talk about the cp being a bi product of what is happening beneath the pattern, are you hinting of accumulation and distribution?","a":"naughtypip","d":"","n":"#28","p":2,"im":[],"m":28},{"id":"3drive_p2_29","t":"Hi all,\n\nA few examples of 3Drives setups:\n\nAL","a":"AL","d":"","n":"#29","p":2,"im":["b442a861e0608a52dbd82c2c40e15e1d5df041b7","953ffce1f336af96463bfd07cb2ac11ace70a0b8","ce0bc19bdd10466fdf63629167904f9158724ff2","c88b446ca0f75e6aaa35cbc4ae646c7e64f68b08","7663a24b07bc79311be579fcb55005831ec64167","049e9d585f4c363efdae70f8e03794b5671779df","5fc853f8b4ec29ee62219d48e7d7c881403d227a","8a758a952382a8bc388363c33b22c60e23e13dec"],"m":29},{"id":"3drive_p2_30","t":"A few more:","a":"AL","d":"","n":"#30","p":2,"im":["4b950db48478798eb09fe2bea2685d0622de3a33","de7ac69f60cba8865024dcc0d400937e36a0d73f"],"m":30},{"id":"3drive_p2_31","t":"Hi, If,thanks so much for managing such a good place for us. I am a newbie and I do think your homework is so helpful. Here is the chart I find, AU daily. Is this a proper 3Drive?\n\nI will look for more like this one if it's a correct chart. Forgive my ugly English please, it's not my mother language.","a":"xiaoxin","d":"","n":"#31","p":2,"im":["c294f064f802f828b67ab5b5ebdad080fb53250c"],"m":31},{"id":"3drive_p2_32","t":"Hi Xiaoxin. Thanks for the kind words It has 4 drives, but the concept is just the same - price taking out orders (compressing) on the way to the zone.\n\nNice find.\n\nLooking forward to seeing more from you:)\n\nIf","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#32","p":2,"im":[],"m":32},{"id":"3drive_p2_33","t":"Josh wrote:\n\nYup. That's a 3drive.\n\nI definitely agree with the statement in bold - too many people don't know how to think for themselves, the only way you become a great trader is by discovering things for yourself.\n\nI know I ask people to look for patterns - this is to get a concrete starting point in learning to read price. Once folk start to seek out these patterns, they'll begin to notice a myriad other phenomena, which will become very important EUREKA moments for them - I just love those EUREKA moments:cheer:","a":"beebolbod","d":"","n":"#33","p":2,"im":[],"m":33},{"id":"3drive_p2_34","t":"Thank you for your treasure time checking my homework,If. How about this one? Is it nice?","a":"xiaoxin","d":"","n":"#34","p":2,"im":["90d839f9e14e790fa7798b1495033cc2c193b3e3","07a93737579f6195a8f2b987309b61108f6b8009"],"m":34},{"id":"3drive_p2_35","t":"Hi, If, For the Aussie chart you point out there are 4 Drives. I labled it on the chart, is it right? Thanks","a":"xiaoxin","d":"","n":"#35","p":2,"im":["1c3f28fc84179a72c7f064c8b27b1ef3b0f74c7e"],"m":35},{"id":"3drive_p2_36","t":"Yup. Just so:)","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#36","p":2,"im":[],"m":36},{"id":"3drive_p2_37","t":"IS THIS A 3DRIVE HAPPENING NOW INTO SZ?","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#37","p":2,"im":["7584bd001fbf3e6c5a9f358c40938215d07a51af"],"m":37},{"id":"3drive_p2_38","t":"We like each demand of a 3drive up to be spiked on the way, to form our compression up, so I'd have to say that this isn't an ideal one, if at all","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#38","p":2,"im":[],"m":38},{"id":"3drive_p2_39","t":"Ifmyante wrote: We like each demand of a 3drive up to be spiked on the way, to form our compression up, so I'd have to say that this isn't an ideal one, if at all\n\nYou mean leaving tails on chart when reacting to previous demands? Seeing strong moves up and away from the zones?","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#39","p":2,"im":[],"m":39},{"id":"3drive_p2_40","t":"hornet wrote:\n\nIfmyante wrote: We like each demand of a 3drive up to be spiked on the way, to form our compression up, so I'd have to say that this isn't an ideal one, if at all\n\nYup, we want to see compression in action","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#40","p":2,"im":[],"m":40},{"id":"3drive_p2_41","t":"Ifmyante wrote:\n\nhornet wrote:\n\nIfmyante wrote: We like each demand of a 3drive up to be spiked on the way, to form our compression up, so I'd have to say that this isn't an ideal one, if at all\n\nBy leaving tails what we get is fake indication of buying power while in reality they are using up all buy order giving way to a free fall sort of move when reacting at SZ. So there is no 3drive without CP. Correct?","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#41","p":2,"im":[],"m":41},{"id":"3drive_p2_42","t":"Correct","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#42","p":2,"im":[],"m":42},{"id":"3drive_p2_43","t":"Hi all! Here is my 5th assignment 3Drive!. What I did was I look up the daily TF and look for turning points I then check the H4 TF for any 3Drive pattern. One thing I am unsure of is, at what point of the pattern do you trigger a trade??\n\nFor each scenario I will post 2 charts. One HTF and one LTF where the analysis was done. Thanks.","a":"bcho018","d":"","n":"#43","p":2,"im":["e732bc289645399de4b7babfe01ab3bb3fc6beb3","7c7f188ae8eb2edf997b5e0931fab2404340644e"],"m":43},{"id":"3drive_p2_44","t":"","a":"bcho018","d":"","n":"#44","p":2,"im":["42486dfc7d655e852acaf60c43ce5ba9e5e1b1ea","6381dc5c467e761e55fa41b9b2047d41b1dddf44","86bcbdd4196910f15052529c3e6eca61ceed4458","a6bee7686d52444c1fda3fcb5312c8f75bc7a09c","d75a1d7f9123150e7a581c82c72a983476a31ded","f2da8fec7aa4c1e09d3aa7775be09a578b75635a"],"m":44},{"id":"3drive_p2_45","t":"I have never even heard of this before.","a":"HoyPip12","d":"","n":"#45","p":2,"im":["1038833317850895557f8cf1ac8338e31349255b"],"m":45},{"id":"3drive_p2_46","t":"3 attempts to get up there, each one consuming the last demand. Yup. Looks good","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#46","p":2,"im":[],"m":46},{"id":"3drive_p2_47","t":"Hi everyone,\n\nI've been watching the live market to see if I can spot the various patterns set up in real time.\n\nWould this be considered a 3Drive?\n\nThe area within the gold rectangle is one of historic support.","a":"Simon","d":"","n":"#47","p":2,"im":["c1dd057a7f540b2186a0225ec810aa39fc86abda"],"m":47},{"id":"3drive_p2_48","t":"The 3Drive onto S/D can be a strong indication that price will turn.\n\nIt shows that price advances are slowing down, while compressing up/down, taking out orders as it goes.\n\nHomework:\n\npair, any timeframe","a":"Nosbigs","d":"","n":"#48","p":2,"im":[],"m":48},{"id":"3drive_p2_49","t":"There's an irony to this one. I spent so much of yesterday determined to see compression in the market that in the end I overlooked what the market was actually telling me, which is that it was 3Driving down to the gift area that was a W1 SR Flip confluenced with M30 Demand.\n\nThis shouldn't happen again. It seems one of the very positive benefits of doing one's homework in the live market is that it tends to stick.\n\nA Beatles lyric springs to mind. I won't bore you with the entire song but it has something to do with \"getting better all the time\"!","a":"Simon","d":"","n":"#49","p":2,"im":["840b76a4db3a627f65ab778d4b2bfd5bb4f7c88f"],"m":49},{"id":"3drive_p2_50","t":"I missed trading this one because for now I'm focussing solely on the EU. But things with that pair were quiet after this morning's CP and move down so I began to take a look around. It's amazing what we can see when we open our eyes.","a":"Simon","d":"","n":"#50","p":2,"im":["c8648e3fa6876747d08fa12c6edd2d5cde1ca2c4"],"m":50}],"images":[{"k":"79a41afb65d299d95edf842793287990fa5f3d1c","t":"assets/thumbs/79a41afb65d299d95edf842793287990fa5f3d1c.webp","f":"assets/images/79a41afb65d299d95edf842793287990fa5f3d1c.png","w":1493,"h":584,"b":42607,"o":"79a41afb65d299d95edf842793287990fa5f3d1c.png","p":2,"pid":"3drive_p2_26"},{"k":"c800cfa8a3ff233e98399a562c4642e0355f29f5","t":"assets/thumbs/c800cfa8a3ff233e98399a562c4642e0355f29f5.webp","f":"assets/images/c800cfa8a3ff233e98399a562c4642e0355f29f5.png","w":1493,"h":584,"b":77963,"o":"c800cfa8a3ff233e98399a562c4642e0355f29f5.png","p":2,"pid":"3drive_p2_27"},{"k":"b442a861e0608a52dbd82c2c40e15e1d5df041b7","t":"assets/thumbs/b442a861e0608a52dbd82c2c40e15e1d5df041b7.webp","f":"assets/images/b442a861e0608a52dbd82c2c40e15e1d5df041b7.png","w":1366,"h":738,"b":61037,"o":"b442a861e0608a52dbd82c2c40e15e1d5df041b7.png","p":2,"pid":"3drive_p2_29"},{"k":"953ffce1f336af96463bfd07cb2ac11ace70a0b8","t":"assets/thumbs/953ffce1f336af96463bfd07cb2ac11ace70a0b8.webp","f":"assets/images/953ffce1f336af96463bfd07cb2ac11ace70a0b8.png","w":1366,"h":768,"b":75389,"o":"953ffce1f336af96463bfd07cb2ac11ace70a0b8.png","p":2,"pid":"3drive_p2_29"},{"k":"ce0bc19bdd10466fdf63629167904f9158724ff2","t":"assets/thumbs/ce0bc19bdd10466fdf63629167904f9158724ff2.webp","f":"assets/images/ce0bc19bdd10466fdf63629167904f9158724ff2.png","w":1366,"h":738,"b":62925,"o":"ce0bc19bdd10466fdf63629167904f9158724ff2.png","p":2,"pid":"3drive_p2_29"},{"k":"c88b446ca0f75e6aaa35cbc4ae646c7e64f68b08","t":"assets/thumbs/c88b446ca0f75e6aaa35cbc4ae646c7e64f68b08.webp","f":"assets/images/c88b446ca0f75e6aaa35cbc4ae646c7e64f68b08.png","w":1366,"h":738,"b":57521,"o":"c88b446ca0f75e6aaa35cbc4ae646c7e64f68b08.png","p":2,"pid":"3drive_p2_29"},{"k":"7663a24b07bc79311be579fcb55005831ec64167","t":"assets/thumbs/7663a24b07bc79311be579fcb55005831ec64167.webp","f":"assets/images/7663a24b07bc79311be579fcb55005831ec64167.png","w":1366,"h":738,"b":53176,"o":"7663a24